    "raw": "Plant Fibre Sewing",
    "value": "植物纤维缝纫"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned the basics of sewing and can now create simple articles out of woven plant fibre.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已掌握了缝纫的基础知识，现在可以用编织的植物纤维制作简单的物品了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion1/0",
    "raw": "Simple Fashion",
    "value": "简单时装"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nBy applying your knowledge of sewing, you can now make many simple fashionable items out of plant fibre fabric.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n运用您的缝纫知识，您现在可以用植物纤维织物制作许多简单的时尚物品。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing2/0",
    "raw": "Cotton Sewing",
    "value": "棉花缝纫"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYour sewing skill has improved. You are now able to spin cotton into usable wool for use in all sorts of stuff.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您的缝纫技能提升了。您现在可以将棉花纺成可用的纱线，用于制作各种各样的物品。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Fashion",
    "value": "高级时装"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've become quite knowledgeable about galactic fashion trends and can make better cotton-based clothing to spice up your appearance.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已对星际的时尚潮流了如指掌，现在可以制作更出色的棉质服装，为您的形象增添魅力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing3/0",
    "raw": "Silk Sewing",
    "value": "丝绸缝纫"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou now have the talent to weave silk into sheets used for crafting advanced armors and furniture.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您现在拥有将丝绸编织成布料的天赋，这些布料可用于制作高级盔甲和家具。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion3/0",
    "raw": "Fashion Mastery",
    "value": "时装精通"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/fashion3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nSo great is your artistry with fashionable clothing creation that you can make beautiful gowns that are sure to get you a discount when trading goods with space stations by virtue of your sheer magnificence.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您在设计时装方面的艺术造诣是如此之高，以至于能制作出华美的礼服。当您与太空站进行商品交易时，仅凭这非凡的华彩，都必定能为您赢得折扣。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4a/0",
    "raw": "Synthetic Fabrics",
    "value": "合成纤维织物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4a/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nNot just limited to natural threads, you can weave fabrics out of inorganic materials. You are now able to create a synthetic material which is as durable as kevlar, but far more comfortable to wear.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您的编织技艺已不再局限于天然线材，还能使用无机材料织造织物。您现在能够制造出一种合成材料，它和凯夫拉纤维一样坚固，但穿着起来要舒适得多。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4b/0",
    "raw": "Mutavisk Sewing",
    "value": "缪缃草缝纫"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing4b/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nMutavisk is the hardest natural fibre to weave, but you've figured out how by applying fungal ichor during the weaving process. You can now spin Bio-Thread, which, in addition to being exquisitely beautiful, is incredibly resistant to radiation.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n缪缃草是最难编织的天然纤维，但您已掌握了在编织过程中使用真菌液浆的方法。您现在可以纺制生物线材，它除了精美绝伦之外，还具有难以置信的抗辐射能力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing5/0",
    "raw": "Peerless Sewing",
    "value": "绝世缝纫"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/sewing5/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou've mastered the art of sewing. So great is your skill that you can weave the atom-thick Graphene into your synthetic material, creating a nearly indestructible cloth for use in the highest-quality armors available.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您已精通缝纫的艺术。您的技艺是如此高超，以至于能将原子厚度的石墨烯编织进合成材料中，从而制造出一种近乎坚不可摧的布料，专用于现有最高品质的盔甲。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/cooking1/0",
    "raw": "Culinary Arts",
    "value": "烹饪艺术"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/cooking1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou're learning to prepare something more complex than simple campfire food. You can now create a Kitchen Counter to prepare advanced dishes. You also learn quite a few basic recipes.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您正在学习烹饪比简单的篝火餐更复杂的食物。您现在可以建造一个厨房柜台来制作高级菜肴，同时还将学会不少基础食谱。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze1/0",
    "raw": "Alcohol Creation",
    "value": "酒精制造"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nBrewing and winemaking are some pretty handy skills to know for an aspiring alcoholic. You can now dip your toes into the craft of booze-making. A word of warning, though - it's a complicated process. You may want to ask a master brewer at the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset; for advice.\n\n^yellow;Did you know?^reset; Frackin' Universe incorporated the beer-brewing system from the Starbooze mod way back in 2015!",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n对于一位有抱负的豪饮者而言，酿造与制酒是非常实用的技能。您现在可以涉足酿酒工艺了。不过要提醒您 - 这个过程相当复杂。您或许该向^orange;科学前哨站^reset;的酿酒大师请教一下。\n\n^yellow;你知道吗？^reset;富兰克林的宇宙早在2015年就整合了Starbooze模组中的啤酒酿造系统！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Alcohols",
    "value": "高级酒精"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've become quite skilled at brewing. Such talent comes with benefits: you've put to paper some recipes for strange beverages that are sure to be the talk of connoisseurs across the galaxy.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您的酿酒技艺已颇为精湛。这份才华带来了实实在在的好处：您已经在纸上记录下了一些奇特饮品的配方，这些配方必将成为全宇宙鉴赏家们热议的话题。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze3/0",
    "raw": "Brewing Mastery",
    "value": "酿造精通"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/booze3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour mastery of alcohol is so great that you can make bizarre and esoteric brews with flavors that trascend reality in ways never seen before.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您对酒的掌控已臻化境，竟能酿出风味超乎现实、前所未见的奇异绝酿。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony1/0",
    "raw": "Colony Creation",
    "value": "殖民地创立"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've gained the skills needed to govern a large colony. You can now build a ^orange;Colony Station^reset; at your Inventor's Table, allowing you to craft several colony automation devices.\n\n^yellow;Colony System Guide^reset;: The basis of your colony is the Colony Core, a device which passively collects rent from (and only from) Mk2 Tenant Deeds, which generate no rent on their own - they are co-dependent.\n\nThe happier your tenants are, the more rent they will pay. Happiness can be increased by constructing various add-ons for your colony, which can also generate resources, doing so faster the more tenants you have. There is a limit of one of each add-on per colony.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已掌握管理大型殖民地所需的技能。现在您可以在发明者工作台制作^orange;殖民工作站^reset;，它能用来制造数种殖民地自动化设备。\n\n^yellow;殖民地系统指南^reset;：您殖民地的基础是殖民核心。这个设备会（且仅会）被动收取来自Mk2租户契约的租金，而这些契约本身并不产生租金，它们是相互依存的。\n\n您的租户越幸福，支付的租金就越多。通过为殖民地建造各种附加模块可以提升幸福度，这些模块也能生产资源，您拥有的租户越多，资源生产速度就越快。每个殖民地每种附加模块仅限安装一个。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/canvas/0",
    "raw": "Canvas Creation",
    "value": "画布制作"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/canvas/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've gotten pretty good at working with cotton. You can now spin cotton into durable and useful canvas sheets at your Sewing Machine.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您如今已是运用棉花的好手。现在，您可以在缝纫机上将棉花纺成耐用又实用的帆布了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/painting/0",
    "raw": "Painting",
    "value": "绘画"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/painting/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've taken up the hobby of painting. With canvas as your... canvas, you can now create pretty decorative art pieces to hang around your lab.\n\nIf you delve into more...^cyan;unusual^reset; artistic pursuits, you'll find a whole new world of strangeness awaiting you.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您已培养出绘画的爱好。以帆布作为您的...画布，您现在可以创作漂亮的装饰艺术作品，点缀于实验室四周。\n\n若您投身于更为...^cyan;非凡^reset;的艺术追求，将会发现一个充满奇异的全新世界正静候您的探索。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony2/0",
    "raw": "Improved Colonies",
    "value": "改良殖民"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou can make some more add-ons for your colony. You've also realized that your colonists might make perfect test subjects... who cares how happy they are if you're making good use of them?",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您可以为殖民地制作更多附加模块了。您也意识到，您的殖民者或许能成为完美的实验对象...若能充分利用他们，谁又会在乎他们是否幸福呢？"
  },
