  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/colony3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've made some even more advanced colony add-ons, some of which may overstep some ethical bounds. People are a resource, after all!",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您制造出了一些更为先进的殖民地附加模块，其中一些设计或许已逾越了某些伦理界限。毕竟，人力本身也是一种资源！"
