  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/crew1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nSure, there's merit to traveling with friends, but with mercenaries you won't need friends. Though 'reliable' mercs may pass you up, you can nonetheless hire some greenhorns eager for work at the ^orange;Science Outpost^reset;.\n\nHold ^green;shift^reset; while using a crew contract to satisfy your inner xenophobe, and guarantee a recruit of the same race as you.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n诚然，与朋友同行自有其好处，但和雇佣兵一起旅行，您就不再需要朋友了。话虽如此，那些“可靠”的老兵可能会嫌你不够格，但您总能在^orange;科学前哨站^reset;雇到一些渴望工作的新手。\n\n在使用船员合同时，按住^green;Shift^reset;键即可满足您内心的排外倾向，并保证招募到与您同一种族的船员。"
  },
  {
