    "path": "/strings/research/crew3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nLeading and commanding comes naturally to you, and money is no object when it comes to talent. You've paid off informants for knowledge of some very talented individuals who you can convince to work under you for the right price.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n既然领导与命令对您来说轻而易举，那么为人才投入金钱自然也非难事。您已投资线人，网罗到一批杰出人才的信息，可招揽他们以合适的报酬为您效力。"
